;; app-legal-entity — the legal-entity appview.
;;
;; ⚠ **これは repo 全体のビルド設定ではない。** この repo は 3 つの独立した
;; サブツリーを持ち、それぞれ自分のビルド根を持つ（README §1）:
;;
;;   wasm/…-le9k4x2m/  appview（Cloudflare Worker）  ← ここ。ソースは src/、
;;                                                     設定は repo 直下のこの 2 ファイル
;;   kotoba/           TypeScript の登記レジストリ   ← kotoba/package.json + tsc/vitest
;;   lg-clj/           LangGraph の Clojure 移植     ← lg-clj/bb.edn + bb
;;
;; appview の wrangler.jsonc だけがサブディレクトリに残り（deploy 単位なので）、
;; ソースとビルド設定は repo 直下に置いた。同型移行の app-ongakuka / app-lo /
;; app-po / app-cowork / app-analytics が全く同じ形（`appview/<name>/wrangler.jsonc`
;; + 直下の `src/` `shadow-cljs.edn` `deps.edn`）なので、それに合わせている。
;; したがって wrangler の `main` は `../../dist/worker.js` である。
;;
;; The Worker is ClojureScript, per the repo-wide runtime order in the
;; superproject CLAUDE.md (kotoba wasm > clojurewasm > ClojureScript > nbb).
;; Keeping the entry in cljs rather than .kotoba is ADR-2606290000's standing
;; call: kotoba's ingress capability is :native-aot/:wasm-aot pending. The
;; decision-shaped parts live in .cljc so they are testable without a browser,
;; and are the first thing that moves to .kotoba when ingress qualifies.
;;
;; The design system is pinned to the tip of kotoba-lang/jp-go-digital-design-system
;; as measured 2026-08-18: 2e2d191 is BOTH the remote HEAD and the commit the shared
;; west checkout on this workstation is sitting on, with a clean working tree. So the
;; library the tests run against (which comes off the west checkout via --classpath)
;; and the library the bundle links (which comes off this git dep) are the same
;; bytes. That coincidence is recorded here because it does NOT always hold — the
;; app-air-cargo migration on the same day found the west checkout six days behind
;; the pin and had to run its render against an extraction of the pinned sha instead.
;; If you touch this pin, re-measure rather than assuming.
{:paths ["src"]
 :deps {io.github.kotoba-lang/jp-go-digital-design-system
        {:git/url "https://github.com/kotoba-lang/jp-go-digital-design-system"
         :git/sha "2e2d191e9e1731ce6865c79dab163a5d74249053"}}
 :aliases
 {:cljs {:extra-deps {org.clojure/clojurescript {:mvn/version "1.11.132"}
                      thheller/shadow-cljs {:mvn/version "2.28.20"}}}
  :test {:extra-paths ["test"]
         :extra-deps {io.github.cognitect-labs/test-runner
                      {:git/tag "v0.5.1" :git/sha "dfb30dd"}}
         :main-opts ["-m" "cognitect.test-runner"]
         :exec-fn cognitect.test-runner.api/test}}}
